<!-- 1.140.0 5e 战斗专长 6 个（改编自 5e 2014 / 2024）：双持者、盾牌大师、长柄武器大师、弩专家、冲锋者、擒抱者。
     每个都附带 +1 属性（bonusAbilities）。数值效果（statOffsets / statFactors）合进冒险者状态；规则效果在 Source/AdventurerFeats3.cs（Feats3，走 HeroInfo 缓存的 f3 位）。
     图标：ArtSource/RaceArt/draw_feats4_1140.py → Textures/LP/Feats/。 -->
<Defs>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_DualWielder</defName>
    <label>双持者</label>
    <description>两手都闲不住。近战冷却 ×0.85，近战闪避 +8，近战命中 ×1.05。附带力量或敏捷 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/DualWielder</iconPath>
    <order>34</order>
    <skillReqs><li><skill>Melee</skill><level>6</level></li></skillReqs>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Str</li><li>Dex</li></bonusAbilities>
    <statFactors><MeleeCooldownFactor>0.85</MeleeCooldownFactor><MeleeHitChance>1.05</MeleeHitChance></statFactors>
    <statOffsets><MeleeDodgeChance>8</MeleeDodgeChance></statOffsets>
    <enemyTags><li>melee</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_ShieldMaster</defName>
    <label>盾牌大师</label>
    <description>盾不只是用来挡的。护甲 +6%，近战闪避 +6；戴着护盾腰带时近战闪避再 +10，近战命中 25% 把目标推开 1 格并眩晕 1 秒。附带力量或体质 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/ShieldMaster</iconPath>
    <order>35</order>
    <skillReqs><li><skill>Melee</skill><level>6</level></li></skillReqs>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Str</li><li>Con</li></bonusAbilities>
    <statOffsets><ArmorRating_Sharp>0.06</ArmorRating_Sharp><ArmorRating_Blunt>0.06</ArmorRating_Blunt><MeleeDodgeChance>6</MeleeDodgeChance></statOffsets>
    <enemyTags><li>melee</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_PolearmMaster</defName>
    <label>长柄武器大师</label>
    <description>枪尾也是武器。用长柄近战武器（质量 ≥2 的刺击 / 砍击武器）时，每 3 秒第一次命中后立刻用枪尾再补一下（50% 伤害）；近战冷却 ×0.9。附带力量或敏捷 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/PolearmMaster</iconPath>
    <order>36</order>
    <skillReqs><li><skill>Melee</skill><level>6</level></li></skillReqs>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Str</li><li>Dex</li></bonusAbilities>
    <statFactors><MeleeCooldownFactor>0.9</MeleeCooldownFactor></statFactors>
    <enemyTags><li>melee</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_CrossbowExpert</defName>
    <label>弩专家</label>
    <description>上弦快得像换气。用弓弩（中世纪以下的远程武器）时瞄准时间 ×0.7、射击冷却 ×0.8；所有远程武器射击精度 ×1.05。附带敏捷 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/CrossbowExpert</iconPath>
    <order>37</order>
    <skillReqs><li><skill>Shooting</skill><level>6</level></li></skillReqs>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Dex</li></bonusAbilities>
    <statFactors><ShootingAccuracyPawn>1.05</ShootingAccuracyPawn></statFactors>
    <enemyTags><li>ranged</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_Charger</defName>
    <label>冲锋者</label>
    <description>带着冲劲砍下去。跑动中（1 秒内移动过）的近战命中伤害 ×1.3，并且 25% 把目标撞开 1 格；移动 +0.2。附带力量或敏捷 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/Charger</iconPath>
    <order>38</order>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Str</li><li>Dex</li></bonusAbilities>
    <statOffsets><MoveSpeed>0.2</MoveSpeed></statOffsets>
    <enemyTags><li>melee</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
  <LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>
    <defName>LP_Feat_Grappler</defName>
    <label>擒抱者</label>
    <description>抓住了就别想跑。近战命中 25% 让体型不超过自己 1.5 倍的目标 3 秒内不能移动；对被擒抱、眩晕或倒地的目标近战伤害 ×1.5。附带力量 +1。</description>
    <iconPath>LP/Feats/Grappler</iconPath>
    <order>39</order>
    <skillReqs><li><skill>Melee</skill><level>5</level></li></skillReqs>
    <ability>Str</ability><abilityMin>13</abilityMin>
    <bonusAbilities><li>Str</li></bonusAbilities>
    <enemyTags><li>melee</li></enemyTags>
  </LichPhylactery.LP_FeatDef>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_FeatGrappled</defName>
    <label>被擒抱</label>
    <description>被擒抱者抓住了：3 秒内不能移动。</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.9,0.6,0.5)</defaultLabelColor>
    <stages><li><statFactors><MoveSpeed>0</MoveSpeed></statFactors></li></stages>
    <comps><li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears"><disappearsAfterTicks>180</disappearsAfterTicks><showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime></li></comps>
  </HediffDef>
</Defs>
